   Filter: leaky(ft_barrier.a)
   ->  Custom Scan (TessFilter) on public.ft_t
         Output: ft_t.a, NULL::integer
         Batch Filter: ((ft_t.b < 5) AND (ft_t.a > 10))
         ->  Custom Scan (TessTestSource) on public.ft_t
               Output: ft_t.a, ft_t.b
               Foreign Path: first
               Offered Usable: (b < 5), (a > 10)
(10 rows)

