                              QUERY PLAN                               
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
 Append
   ->  Custom Scan (TessFilter) on ft_parted_far ft_parted_1
         Filter: peek(b)
         Batch Filter: (ft_parted_1.b < 5)
         ->  Custom Scan (TessTestSource) on ft_parted_far ft_parted_1
               Foreign Path: first
               Source Exact: (ft_parted_1.a > 10)
   ->  Custom Scan (TessFilter) on ft_parted_near ft_parted_2
         Filter: peek(b)
         Batch Filter: ((ft_parted_2.b < 5) AND (ft_parted_2.a > 10))
         ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on ft_parted_near ft_parted_2
(11 rows)

