               Source Prune: ((ft_parted_1.b < 5) AND (ft_parted_1.b > 2))
               Source Check: own
   ->  Custom Scan (TessFilter) on ft_parted_near ft_parted_2
         Batch Filter: ((ft_parted_2.b < 5) AND (ft_parted_2.a > 10) AND (ft_parted_2.b > 2))
         ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on ft_parted_near ft_parted_2
(11 rows)

